Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.51,0:21:26.26,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}よふかしのうた
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:28.39,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}照らしてって moonlight
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.55,0:21:30.39,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}目を奪ってブルーライト
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:32.81,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ネオンサインが呼ぶ表裏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.81,0:21:34.81,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}よふかしのうた
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.81,0:21:36.73,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}連れ去って midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.89,0:21:38.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}血走った red eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.81,0:21:41.73,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人達の子守唄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.77,0:21:43.94,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ガキの頃から夜が好きだった
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:45.99,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}9時に寝るのは何か嫌だった
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.99,0:21:48.11,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}なんと無くただ勿体無かった
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.11,0:21:50.24,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}お前の事がもっと知りたかった
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:52.53,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}いわゆる三文の得
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.53,0:21:55.45,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}投げ売ってでも見たいのさ もっと奥の奥の奥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.45,0:21:56.75,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}色濃く紐解く
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.75,0:21:58.96,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}12オクロックから丑の刻まで
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.04,0:22:00.92,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}初めてお前を跨いだのは、
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:03.71,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}いや初めて跨ったのは確か14
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.80,0:22:05.38,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}俺は何も知らねワナビー
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.38,0:22:07.47,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}手取り足取り全てが新しい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:08.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}姿形にその香り
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.55,0:22:11.30,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}静けさが似合うその黒い肌に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.93,0:22:14.81,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}吸い込まれてた 手招きされるままに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:17.94,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}それからお前は音楽をくれた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:19.77,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}女の裸も見せてくれた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.85,0:22:22.11,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}飲んだ事ねぇ酒に口つけて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.23,0:22:24.15,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}オトンのタバコくすね火を付けた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:25.61,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}やっちゃいけないが溢れて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.61,0:22:27.61,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}知っちゃいけないに塗れてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.15,0:22:29.86,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}迎えに来る闇に紛れて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.91,0:22:31.49,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}お前はいつも気まぐれで…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.49,0:22:33.33,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}よふかしのうた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.33,0:22:35.41,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}照らしてって moonlight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.41,0:22:37.25,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}目を奪ってブルーライト
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.33,0:22:39.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ネオンサインが呼ぶ表裏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:41.63,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}よふかしのうた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.63,0:22:43.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}連れ去って midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:45.75,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}血走った red eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.75,0:22:48.51,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人達の子守唄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.51,0:21:26.26,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}彻夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:28.39,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}明亮的月光
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.55,0:21:30.39,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}夺目的蓝光
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:32.81,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}霓虹灯唤醒了内心的表里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.81,0:21:34.81,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}彻夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.81,0:21:36.73,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}把我们带进深夜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.89,0:21:38.65,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}馋涎欲垂的赤瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.81,0:21:41.73,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人们的摇篮曲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.77,0:21:43.94,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我从儿时就喜欢夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:45.99,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不知为何不喜欢在九点睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.99,0:21:48.11,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}就是感觉很可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.11,0:21:50.24,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}想要更深入地了解你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:52.53,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}也就是所谓的占小便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.53,0:21:55.45,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}即使亏本也想继续深入地了解
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.45,0:21:56.75,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}了解的彻彻底底
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.75,0:21:58.96,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}从12点一直到丑时
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.04,0:22:00.92,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}第一次横跨是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:03.71,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不对  第一次横跨是在14岁的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.80,0:22:05.38,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我是什么也不懂的wannabe
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.38,0:22:07.47,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}一切都对我来说是新鲜的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:08.55,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你的姿态和气味
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.55,0:22:11.30,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}被你那融入寂静的黑色肌肤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.93,0:22:14.81,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}所吸引  无法抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:17.94,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}然后你给我推荐了音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:19.77,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}也给我看了女人的赤裸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.85,0:22:22.11,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}第一次喝了酒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.23,0:22:24.15,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}点了从爸爸那里偷的烟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:25.61,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}干了太多不能干的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.61,0:22:27.61,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}知道了不该知道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.15,0:22:29.86,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我被迎来的黑夜所吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.91,0:22:31.49,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你却一直很随心所欲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.49,0:22:33.33,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}彻夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.33,0:22:35.41,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}明亮的月光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.41,0:22:37.25,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}夺目的蓝光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.33,0:22:39.50,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}霓虹灯唤醒了内心的表里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:41.63,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}彻夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.63,0:22:43.50,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}把我们带进深夜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:45.75,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}馋涎欲垂的赤瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.75,0:22:48.51,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人们的摇篮曲
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,——Title——
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:34.99,Title,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1023,685)}第4夜:不挤吗?
Comment: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:01.02,Comment,,0,0,0,,——Text——
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,上课时不准睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.65,0:00:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.57,0:00:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但是老师你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的没睡够
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你晚上干什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.41,0:00:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,打游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  继续上课
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,老师…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你们听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.29,0:00:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,人在晚上必须睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,成人之后你就算不想也要熬夜的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.51,0:00:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,趁年轻的时候学会健康生活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就连我也能熟练地悄悄出门了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.67,0:03:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠今天在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,平常一直都找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.18,0:03:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么今天就在很容易找到的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,今天还有点不想见面
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,光君  你好慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,因为不知道该怎么面对她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我的认知是正确的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,自己和别人的嘴唇接触…是接吻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我被亲了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底有什么意图  七草荠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,看  马上就开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.93,0:04:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,情侣?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.11,0:04:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还故意让我们看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那就把这个当下酒菜去下一家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次看别人接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.17,0:04:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,想想就明白
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,接吻是情侣或者喜欢的人之间做的事情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  那就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我已经喜欢上了小荠?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:04:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而且会心跳加速
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:05:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不如说…也就是说…就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经达成喜欢吸血鬼的目标了?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.49,0:05:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于能变成吸血鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了  日常  疼痛  痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,崭新的自己  晚上好!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  你怎么在这种地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,白让我在容易找到的地方等你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴您能来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有点恶心…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.69,0:05:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧  什么时候都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,大口吸吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不知羞耻的家伙  别像色狼一样!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天脑袋是不是…进水了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,随你怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:06:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,本人夜守光完成了最难的任务「爱上吸血鬼」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我会开这种玩笑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.71,0:06:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我认真得不能再认真了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,认真的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那…怎么说…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.35,0:06:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我能成为吸血鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,上学  翘课
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,早上  晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友  父母  陌生人…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.37,0:06:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,从所有的束缚中解放
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,终于…终于…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.44,0:07:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,变了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.99,0:07:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能啊  废柴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.45,0:07:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,跟说好的不一样啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.41,0:07:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…你还没有恋爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  怎么没有?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是对昨天的事自作多情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,被亲了一下就认为自己喜欢上了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那是性欲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然把恋爱情感和性欲分开来考虑不太健全
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.11,0:07:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,讲道理…这次就是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是被亲了之后发情了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:07:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,对!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这么喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要再来一次吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好过分  那明明是我的第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你却这么轻浮…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,反正你已经跟很多人…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,真巧啊  我也是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.47,0:08:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次给我真的可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,接吻不是朋友之间做的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还是晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,最近睡眠很浅
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.68,0:09:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是明吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.69,0:09:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,夜守
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,穿着校服…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.61,0:09:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不是要回家吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚起床
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可这是十二点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.82,0:09:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这个点醒着没事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这话原样奉还
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.75,0:09:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你是要去见吸血鬼小姐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我说啊  夜守
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,「人在晚上必须睡觉」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,「趁年轻的时候学会健康生活吧  」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,老师是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这话原样奉还
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我有在好好睡觉的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.65,0:09:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你是一直醒着  然后去学校吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.15,0:09:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,打算这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.49,0:10:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那你也来一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,和小荠一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  等一下等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看我的!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.37,0:10:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你呀  玩得真烂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶  一局也赢不了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.05,0:10:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定玩了很长时间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.93,0:10:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼可是很闲的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,朝井也玩吗  赢了的话我亲你一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.77,0:10:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那玩别的游戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说不想被你亲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.82,0:10:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你跟夜守也是这么说的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  你没说吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.16,0:10:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,就算没说我们也会亲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,等…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.71,0:10:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,夜守
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.76,0:11:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你喜欢什么人  怎么交往
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我都打算支持你的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.43,0:11:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我不能支持这种不检点的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不检点的怪物…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不过光君可没有喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.53,0:11:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来玩什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有几个多人互动游戏  真对不住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.11,0:11:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒也没有很喜欢…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:29.58,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\an7\bord3\c&H006EFF&\3c&H080008&\pos(105,408)}光
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:29.58,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\an7\bord0.3\be5\pos(38,658)}「真是的…大早上就这么有精神、分给我一点该多好」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.29,0:11:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:33.83,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\an7\bord3\c&H006EFF&\3c&H080008&\pos(105,408)}梓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.62,0:11:33.88,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\K151\an7\bord0\2c&HFFFFFF&\2a&HFF&\pos(53,600)}「那就去学校吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:36.67,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\an7\bord3\c&H006EFF&\3c&H080008&\pos(82,408)}未 央
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:36.67,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\K178\an7\bord0\2c&HFFFFFF&\2a&HFF&\pos(53,600)}「跟你一起去也不是不行」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:39.76,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\an7\bord3\c&H006EFF&\3c&H080008&\pos(82,408)}春 菜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.05,0:11:39.76,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\K190\an7\bord0\2c&HFFFFFF&\2a&HFF&\pos(53,600)}「真没办法。走吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧  才刚开始女主角们就这么喜欢男主
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.35,0:11:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没有攻略的价值啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.93,0:11:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这种稍微撩一撩  当天就能办完事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在学校的厕所里就开干了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:11:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,做个人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:11:59.90,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\an7\bord3\c&H006EFF&\3c&H080008&\pos(82,408)}春 菜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.27,0:11:59.90,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\K110\an7\bord0\2c&HFFFFFF&\2a&HFF&\pos(53,600)}「一起去学校吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:11:59.90,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\an7\bord0\2c&HFFFFFF&\2a&HFF&\pos(738,311)\c&HFDFCFF&}去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:11:59.90,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\an7\bord0\2c&HFFFFFF&\2a&HFF&\pos(722,384)\c&HC0BFC4&}不去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么选这个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.53,0:12:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,吓我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,去学校啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.28,0:12:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,太麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.37,0:12:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么在游戏里也这样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.29,0:12:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢有很多人的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.79,0:12:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想跟这些来路不明
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.59,0:12:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,一大早就凑过来大声说话的人一起上学
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.51,0:12:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,语气太认真了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.76,0:12:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,原来还能这么认真地玩Galgame
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:36.60,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\an7\bord3\c&H006EFF&\3c&H080008&\pos(82,408)}未 央
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:36.65,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\K350\an7\bord0\2c&HFFFFFF&\2a&HFF&\pos(53,656)}「真是的! 总是说这种话! 快点跟我走吧!」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  光君
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.65,0:12:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,要被带走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.02,0:12:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶  那让我选它干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,RPG是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:47.70,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\an7\bord3\c&H006EFF&\3c&H080008&\pos(82,408)}由 良
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:47.70,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\K55\an7\bord0\2c&HFFFFFF&\2a&HFF&\pos(53,600)}「哎呀!」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.95,0:12:50.62,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\an7\bord3\c&H006EFF&\3c&H080008&\pos(82,408)}由 良
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.95,0:12:50.62,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\K78\an7\bord0\2c&HFFFFFF&\2a&HFF&\pos(53,600)}「好疼……」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,又出现一个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.91,0:12:53.54,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\an7\bord3\c&H006EFF&\3c&H080008&\pos(105,408)}光
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.37,0:12:53.54,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\K130\an7\bord0\2c&HFFFFFF&\2a&HFF&\pos(53,600)}「对不起! 没事吧?」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.91,0:12:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,话说路这么宽  怎么撞上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.87,0:13:00.42,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\K330\an7\bord0\2c&HFFFFFF&\2a&HFF&\pos(435,609)}巨乳眼睛女生慌张地拿起了被甩出去的手提包
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:12:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,裙子好短
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.09,0:13:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还有胸真的好大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:05.84,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\an7\bord3\c&H006EFF&\3c&H080008&\pos(82,408)}由 良
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:05.84,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\K240\an7\bord0\2c&HFFFFFF&\2a&HFF&\pos(53,656)}「对、对不起! 我先走了…」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢刚才这个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,胸也很大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.18,0:13:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,别总是说「胸」 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你是喜欢那种不怎么说话然后「乳房」很大的女生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.27,0:13:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,「乳房」又是什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.07,0:13:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,比起「胸」「乳房」感觉色色的  不是更好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没有必要说的这么色吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说  你是喜欢胸大的女生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.29,0:13:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不  胸…随便啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,害羞什么啊  你个初中生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,初中生就是会害羞的啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.47,0:13:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他这种地方没怎么变  我很放心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他说在半夜玩  我以为是干那种奇怪的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.56,0:14:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但是出乎意料地正常…吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.77,0:14:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,话说都四点了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候睡觉了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我想吸血
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好  那我保存
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.41,0:14:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,起来继续玩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,什么  难道你们一起睡觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.45,0:14:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…我们没有做那种事情…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,男女一起睡觉已经足够那个了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.17,0:14:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠  你怎么出尔反尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,而且今天是两女一男哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这…也太挤了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你躺下之后才说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好香
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.61,0:14:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这也太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我去学校了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,两个小时后校门就开了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.19,0:14:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…大半夜的很危险啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.40,0:14:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这是凌晨!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,可是外面应该在下雨哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.91,0:14:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我家没有雨伞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你先躲个雨怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在其他地方搞啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我都跟你说了别在朋友面前吸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.10,0:15:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可是这种不道德的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就像香料一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不要把别人当成香料啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,话说这个行为到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.82,0:15:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.74,0:15:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,供给和需求
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,供给和需求?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,首先光君的血真的非常好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.21,0:15:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,其次光君想让我吸他的血
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,供给和…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.09,0:15:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,需求
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,成立!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,合体!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…我完全不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我只能说是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.52,0:16:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…所以说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么想被吸血?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你要跟她说了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.49,0:16:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你就跟她说了吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…明小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我以后想成为吸血鬼!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好  光君说出来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.43,0:16:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你有了梦想?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.55,0:16:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你绞尽脑汁说出的感想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.47,0:16:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直都不擅长说自己的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.02,0:16:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个没有梦想的小屁孩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.19,0:16:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,被吸血鬼吸了之后不就变了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.16,0:16:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,已经圆梦了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对  这个部分最重要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.49,0:17:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没必要说这个  睡觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不能这样  小荠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这个部分才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没那么重要吧  我困了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.54,0:17:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那你先睡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,只是被吸没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须要在爱上她之后被吸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,才能变成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀  别说啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,太害羞了!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我想喜欢上小荠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别说啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,您明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.23,0:17:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,大概懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她虽然很喜欢黄段子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但是对恋爱话题很敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这个话题肯定绕不过去啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.87,0:17:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我也这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  你们说完了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.29,0:17:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…我等雨停了就走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:17:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没有必要躺在一起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我本身也不困
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.97,0:18:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别较劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.27,0:18:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,躺一会说不定就睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.40,0:18:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,明
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  一直让你陪着我们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.82,0:18:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想让你看一下我熬夜在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.29,0:18:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,因为感觉让你担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,夜守
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.05,0:18:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,最近很开心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.01,0:18:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.68,0:18:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你胳膊不累吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.73,0:18:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,放下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.98,0:18:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不难受吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.36,0:18:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在意会碰到手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在意的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.86,0:18:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…毕竟…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.53,0:19:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你不放松肩膀的话睡不着的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,确…确实
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.29,0:19:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…你听到我想成为吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不说什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.55,0:19:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.88,0:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,即使你变成吸血鬼了  我们还能继续做朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟你们已经是前例了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,想要成为什么就做什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你找到了你的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但我会继续劝你来上学的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,即使变成吸血鬼  学习还是很重要的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我很擅长学习啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:19:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,即使只有一丝想来的念头  也要跟我说哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那么晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.81,0:20:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没跟人说晚安了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我总是睡得很快
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.94,0:20:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,雨停了就去学校
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我一点都不困
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.07,0:20:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他以后会来学校吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一定很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.75,0:20:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀  完了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.21,0:20:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,睡了四个小时?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.63,0:20:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,要迟到了!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.84,0:20:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,光  我走了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.97,0:20:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,直接离开就行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.47,0:20:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,明…慢走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:20:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.11,0:21:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.19,0:21:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,睡得香吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,人如果对一天很满足  就能睡得很香
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你满足了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哎
